# Keep command-line build artifacts out of the repository.  This file lives
# inside the delta folder, so the rule travels with the folder if it is
# renamed.
#
# Visual Studio build results are covered by the repository-root .gitignore
# ([Bb]in/, [Oo]bj/, [Dd]ebug/, [Rr]elease/, Intermediate/, *.exe, *.dll, ...).
#
# GNU Make out-of-source build directory (object files and the delta
# executable).  The BUILD ?= build variable is overridable, so ignore any
# build-* variant as well.
build/
build-*/
